Murder of a Cat is a thriller, comedy, mystery film directed by Gillian Greene.

2
00:11:13,333 --> 00:11:19,333
When someone murders his beloved cat, Clinton, an adult child, demands justice.

3
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:56,000
Taking it upon himself to solve the case, he teams up with an unlikely ally, Greta, and
the two set out to find the culprit lurking in their small suburban town.

4
00:22:26,666 --> 00:22:32,666
But as Clinton searches for the truth, he begins to uncover a
conspiracy that goes far deeper than he anticipated.

