Simmons, Dileep Rao, Blythe Danner, and Greg Kinnear.

13
01:12:56,666 --> 01:13:02,666
The film premiered at the 2014 Tribeca Film Festival, and was given a limited theatrical
release in the United States on December 5, 2014, by Gravitas Ventures.

14
01:18:33,333 --> 01:18:39,333
This was Greene's second collaboration with Kranz, Rao, and Simmons.

15
01:24:10,000 --> 01:24:16,000
The first was her directorial debut short film Fanboy.

16
01:29:46,666 --> 01:29:52,666
The film is also the Raimi brothers' second film with Simmons, after the Spider-Man trilogy
(2002–2007), and their second film with Rao, after Drag Me to Hell (2009).

17
01:35:23,333 --> 01:35:29,333
The tone is lighthearted and mind_bending and thought_provoking.
